# Build transients — rebuilt by renderer.mk / wasm.mk. controls.wasm is NO
# LONGER committed: it is a rebuildable projection of this repo's own sources
# (CI builds it via .github/actions/build-controls-wasm; consumers build it from
# the pinned source with the WASI-SDK, and asgard's gate-proven controls.tar is
# the archival recovery route). Every build product stays out of history.
build/
output/*
wasm_harness/target/
wasm_harness/output/
